cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "DitchBook — Colorado ditch company to WDID matches (tier-1)"
authors:
  - family-names: Davis
    given-names: Nick
    affiliation: DitchBook
version: 1.2.0
date-released: 2026-08-04
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ndavipt/ditchbook-open-data"
url: "https://getditchbook.com/data/"
abstract: >-
  Verified matches between Colorado mutual ditch and reservoir companies
  (as registered with the Colorado Secretary of State) and their water
  structures (WDIDs) in Colorado DWR records — the organization-to-WDID
  relationship that public state datasets stopped exposing directly. 327
  companies are matched at tier-1: published only where state records
  agree beyond doubt, with a citation URL to the underlying DWR record
  on every row. Ambiguous candidates are excluded, not guessed.
keywords:
  - Colorado
  - water rights
  - irrigation
  - mutual ditch companies
  - WDID
  - open data
